Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 06:25:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Rename GITHUB_DISPATCH_TOKEN to GH_DISPATCH_TOKEN

GitHub Actions refuses to create a repository secret whose name starts
with the reserved GITHUB_ prefix, discovered while actually adding it
in the console. Renamed the Secret Manager name everywhere it's
referenced (index.js's defineSecret() call, the push-secrets workflow's
env/loop); the JS constant name is unchanged, only the string passed to
defineSecret() and the GitHub secret name itself.

